{"id":120,"slug":"120-clamp-function-dung-de-lam-gi","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Responsive","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"clamp() function dùng để làm gì?","question_en":"What is the clamp() function used for?","answer_vi":"`clamp(min, ưa-thích, max)` khoá một giá trị trong khoảng, và **co giãn liên tục** ở giữa.\n\n```css\nh1 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); }\n/* nhỏ nhất 1.5rem, lớn nhất 2.5rem, ở giữa thì bằng 4% bề rộng viewport */\n\n.container { width: clamp(320px, 90%, 1180px); }\n.section   { padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); }\n```\n\nThay thế cho việc nhảy bậc bằng media query:\n\n```css\n/* cách cũ: đổi đột ngột tại từng ngưỡng */\nh1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 768px)  { h1 { font-size: 2rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 1200px) { h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; } }\n```\n\nCông thức thường dùng cho fluid typography — trộn `rem` với `vw` để vẫn co theo cỡ chữ người dùng đặt:\n\n```css\nfont-size: clamp(1rem, 0.75rem + 1.5vw, 2rem);\n```\n\n**Lưu ý 1:** dùng **thuần `vw`** ở phần giữa (`clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem)`) làm chữ **không đổi theo thiết lập cỡ chữ của hệ điều hành** khi đang ở giữa khoảng — người cần chữ to phóng lên không thấy đổi. Kèm `rem` như công thức trên là an toàn.\n\n**Lưu ý 2:** nếu `min` lớn hơn `max`, `clamp` trả về **`min`** — không báo lỗi, chỉ lặng lẽ sai","answer_en":"`clamp(min, preferred, max)` locks a value into a range and **scales continuously** in between.\n\n```css\nh1 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); }\n/* never below 1.5rem, never above 2.5rem, otherwise 4% of the viewport width */\n\n.container { width: clamp(320px, 90%, 1180px); }\n.section   { padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); }\n```\n\nIt replaces stepping through media queries:\n\n```css\n/* old way: abrupt jumps at each threshold */\nh1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 768px)  { h1 { font-size: 2rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 1200px) { h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; } }\n```\n\nThe usual fluid-typography formula mixes `rem` with `vw` so it still honours the user's font size:\n\n```css\nfont-size: clamp(1rem, 0.75rem + 1.5vw, 2rem);\n```\n\n**Note 1:** a **pure `vw`** middle term (`clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem)`) makes text **ignore the OS font-size setting** while inside the range — a user who enlarges text sees no change. Adding `rem` as above avoids it.\n\n**Note 2:** if `min` is larger than `max`, `clamp` returns **`min`** — no error, just a quiet wrong value","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>clamp(min, ưa-thích, max)</code> khoá một giá trị trong khoảng, và <strong>co giãn liên tục</strong> ở giữa.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"h1 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); }\n/* nhỏ nhất 1.5rem, lớn nhất 2.5rem, ở giữa thì bằng 4% bề rộng viewport */\n\n.container { width: clamp(320px, 90%, 1180px); }\n.section   { padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1.5rem</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4vw</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2.5rem</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* nhỏ nhất 1.5rem, lớn nhất 2.5rem, ở giữa thì bằng 4% bề rộng viewport */</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.container</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">320px</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">90%</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1180px</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.section</span>   { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding-inline</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">16px</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4vw</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">32px</span>); }</code></pre></div><p>Thay thế cho việc nhảy bậc bằng media query:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"/* cách cũ: đổi đột ngột tại từng ngưỡng */\nh1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 768px)  { h1 { font-size: 2rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 1200px) { h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* cách cũ: đổi đột ngột tại từng ngưỡng */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1.5rem</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@media</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">768px</span>)  { <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2rem</span>; } }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@media</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1200px</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2.5rem</span>; } }</code></pre></div><p>Công thức thường dùng cho fluid typography — trộn <code>rem</code> với <code>vw</code> để vẫn co theo cỡ chữ người dùng đặt:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.75rem + 1.5vw, 2rem);\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1rem</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.75rem</span> + <span class=\"hljs-number\">1.5vw</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2rem</span>);</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý 1:</strong> dùng <strong>thuần <code>vw</code></strong> ở phần giữa (<code>clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem)</code>) làm chữ <strong>không đổi theo thiết lập cỡ chữ của hệ điều hành</strong> khi đang ở giữa khoảng — người cần chữ to phóng lên không thấy đổi. Kèm <code>rem</code> như công thức trên là an toàn.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 2:</strong> nếu <code>min</code> lớn hơn <code>max</code>, <code>clamp</code> trả về <strong><code>min</code></strong> — không báo lỗi, chỉ lặng lẽ sai.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>clamp(min, preferred, max)</code> locks a value into a range and <strong>scales continuously</strong> in between.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"h1 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); }\n/* never below 1.5rem, never above 2.5rem, otherwise 4% of the viewport width */\n\n.container { width: clamp(320px, 90%, 1180px); }\n.section   { padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1.5rem</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4vw</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2.5rem</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* never below 1.5rem, never above 2.5rem, otherwise 4% of the viewport width */</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.container</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">320px</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">90%</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1180px</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.section</span>   { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding-inline</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">16px</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4vw</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">32px</span>); }</code></pre></div><p>It replaces stepping through media queries:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"/* old way: abrupt jumps at each threshold */\nh1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 768px)  { h1 { font-size: 2rem; } }\n@media (min-width: 1200px) { h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* old way: abrupt jumps at each threshold */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1.5rem</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@media</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">768px</span>)  { <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2rem</span>; } }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@media</span> (<span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1200px</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2.5rem</span>; } }</code></pre></div><p>The usual fluid-typography formula mixes <code>rem</code> with <code>vw</code> so it still honours the user's font size:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.75rem + 1.5vw, 2rem);\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">clamp</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1rem</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.75rem</span> + <span class=\"hljs-number\">1.5vw</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2rem</span>);</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note 1:</strong> a <strong>pure <code>vw</code></strong> middle term (<code>clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem)</code>) makes text <strong>ignore the OS font-size setting</strong> while inside the range — a user who enlarges text sees no change. Adding <code>rem</code> as above avoids it.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note 2:</strong> if <code>min</code> is larger than <code>max</code>, <code>clamp</code> returns <strong><code>min</code></strong> — no error, just a quiet wrong value.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — clamp()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/clamp"},{"label":"web.dev — min(), max(), and clamp()","url":"https://web.dev/articles/min-max-clamp"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/77-cascade-trong-css-nghia-la-gi","title":"Cascade trong CSS nghĩa là gì?"},{"url":"/q/79-inheritance-trong-css-la-gi","title":"Inheritance trong CSS là gì?"},{"url":"/q/80-don-vi-px-em-rem-vw-vh-khac-nhau","title":"Đơn vị px, em, rem, %, vw, vh khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/81-important-dung-khi-nao-tai-sao-nen-tranh","title":"!important dùng khi nào? Tại sao nên tránh?"},{"url":"/q/87-has-selector-la-gi","title":":has() selector là gì?"},{"url":"/q/88-combinator-selectors-space-khac-nhau","title":"Combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/90-is-where-not-khac-nhau","title":":is(), :where(), :not() khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/91-box-model-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Box model gồm những gì?"}]}